{"posts":[{"id":"cppaz_p3_1","t":"Aaron\n\nHi all,\n\nI have decided to begin another thread beginning focusing on the idea of CP PAZ. I have tried to look for any record of this concept being discussed on the forum, I have however not been able to locate anything.\n\nPlease do flood this thread with your own homework and ideas.\n\nMy first attempt:\n\n1707\n\nAny comments would be dearly appreciated.\n\nDT","a":"—","d":"","n":"#1","p":3,"im":["f4e94a8e4b653847db3a5f0d09a17ed336b9ba99","f75b484b2dfa5054806f26272fdd491841496c69","b3c4b574a35fecf45d9a268b6d8bb4ddaae7d244"],"m":1},{"id":"cppaz_p3_2","t":"Aaron\n\n2 more examples:\n\n1707\n\nDT","a":"—","d":"","n":"#2","p":3,"im":["54b473fa3ab9c6912585b9b258ad8a5f745728a6","69666c7c8c63e8eedddfde0111f6ac77653c538b"],"m":2},{"id":"cppaz_p3_3","t":"Aaron\n\n2 more quick examples, after this I will record a ton of them to post here\n\n1707\n\nIf anyone wants to have a go at posting some examples, please do, it will create a great learning environment for all...\n\nDT","a":"—","d":"","n":"#3","p":3,"im":["d6415769b6046a4b0045d07753c9b30dfcf57cb8","2ec246c560afb15f767001755216e0311451ed60"],"m":3},{"id":"cppaz_p3_4","t":"Aaron\n\n4 more charts...\n\nAny questions or comments??\n\n1707\n\nDT","a":"—","d":"","n":"#4","p":3,"im":["f2504f6a2c79c89cd823c77f5946d4a021fba150","bf1edddeda6e550aeed357caf773ee136c2dadf4","430269f979ebcc76769109d1ed6599ab38c5728a","5f642ea2b64fea7c7f88b78657c49496ee79303a"],"m":4},{"id":"cppaz_p3_5","t":"Aaron\n\nThese CP PAZs work like magic, when I draw the PAZ zone on and watch P.A unfold, it is sometimes so amazing how price reacts so well to these zones.\n\n1.\n\n1707\n\n2.\n\n3.\n\nDT","a":"—","d":"","n":"#5","p":3,"im":["7afde8c9df791e58f4a3ad7cabaa1123179f5c68","b604e377416dbfc013986349932a08a0d047d4f7","1c797c894696e328704a5bfbe3aa0e426a797e8f"],"m":5},{"id":"cppaz_p3_6","t":"Thats good work with the CP zones DT. I have to say that I can have some difficulty myself with seeing all of them. It can also be tough to catch the moves through them. Have you noticed that sometimes price will engulf into the zone, but not go all the way through it? There are times that I will try and short the source of an engulf into a CP PAZ and price will pass right through the source of that engulf stopping me out.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#6","p":3,"im":[],"m":6},{"id":"cppaz_p3_7","t":"Aaron\n\nHi H,\n\nYes I have noticed when price does engulf into the zone, and this is when I would definitely try to short the source to try and catch the move, I guess when price just goes right through your stop, it is just one of them trades which is a loss, nothing much to worry about tho, have you seen the rewards on some of the CP PAZ zones I have posted, this would easily outweigh any losses, most produce over 5:1 RR, you could be right only twice to still pocket some profit\n\nH, please do post some examples here, and we will work on it together...\n\n1707\n\nDT","a":"—","d":"","n":"#7","p":3,"im":[],"m":7},{"id":"cppaz_p3_8","t":"Sounds good man. Its almost 1AM here and I am ready for bed. I will get some charts here this weekend. I have worked with CP before and it is amazing if you can catch the moves. Nothing wrong with some nice quick moves with good R:R.\n\nLaters,","a":"—","d":"","n":"#8","p":3,"im":[],"m":8},{"id":"cppaz_p3_9","t":"Aaron\n\nA few more examples:\n\n2012\n\n1.\n\n1707\n\n2.\n\nThe next one I try to search for a LTF entry too.\n\n3.\n\nHere are two examples of where I believe price did not give an opportunity to enter.\n\n4.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#9","p":3,"im":["be2d67fefba3dfcd90a56bc026c90fe47d36563d","ec7c0beefb92d9dbb862be11773eb900bf3a81d8","5c8a2581b2472aaea442ac8069c3027f07976e90","2851dffc5224fdb4a8b29fc24e8c583d4a9d65b7","5a1cc66b1be2af3fedd680b5ef2ce10869aa9a8b","306038fd3ca64b223d131729e493ea7c6d005fcc","f62e4d29e7404832b4ae9f4a0be875b3117fcea6"],"m":9},{"id":"cppaz_p3_10","t":"Aaron\n\nA few more examples, any comments on anything I can improve would be greatly appreciated...\n\n1707\n\nDT","a":"—","d":"","n":"#10","p":3,"im":["d009ed03e3a4f5e71957120edf94232f6e80b805","e6c400d96f931b3cf840118ed8a3d5b7afe57d67","a1be4e444453bf07cdcd32b3db12d5ae00bc2fe1","064f5d48f364155cd38023655b721f3202724bb4","454f03ba1c1044adbeea564e74f6023d4332b584"],"m":10},{"id":"cppaz_p3_11","t":"Aaron\n\n5 more examples:\n\n1707\n\nDT","a":"—","d":"","n":"#11","p":3,"im":["28658bf89f8171ac0a94ea0d988bec9d06943ab0","075ae3e177a66f08a982228cc23a94c81736dd3c","a85bc3435351ae147abc4bdd7bb9fe596b6b3a77","174d423e2636a6142d64c96e5e0dd0e2154b6be0","46002c7f7a0347925e5ab8506ef89ebf5c85522c"],"m":11},{"id":"cppaz_p3_12","t":"Aaron\n\n1707","a":"—","d":"","n":"#12","p":3,"im":["66274423d12aa346fb90302a707d5198e243ab03","ce097e83f187bb7f93c2dc71fd3fc59d9cfb5990","ac2ae9c280fedd055f58a63a07250366a129c46f","efa02e2101e71efe2b382db983029aee1f59c1be","d9747b45fe9b2ce0bb7cee1ab8fe6979b4250e98"],"m":12},{"id":"cppaz_p3_13","t":"Aaron\n\n1707","a":"—","d":"","n":"#13","p":3,"im":["d5e9da04dde20b55923eade6fc3ce1d282d29a6f","e9677ead11953512ee7e44a49e084f266c689742","c26a0bab2722b911c6f6dcd5969b1412a3a7a6b6","6248af81ecf2e4560ba1420ad46a274535dc0faf","90a65892de04fc4568001e210f5a0fbc470c1d74"],"m":13},{"id":"cppaz_p3_14","t":"Aaron\n\n1707","a":"—","d":"","n":"#14","p":3,"im":["1c07256fa49f5114b93e96605cc5c6a932ddfa0e","f08abcbb2e9103677cf9420d23c7479b287d0783","3a89bf561ffcaf9ed4ef60e15ba6e7a622a8dce1","a211ff9943c5322158f4ac3ac1cce889c608a361","8d137a8927deab857ddabbb936292374cd9a89eb","8abcb80591e2216b78eadbe4990c5b10b7910b8e","1668d91c5d237c7aa7d72fafc8024a2e3f6ea782"],"m":14},{"id":"cppaz_p3_15","t":"Aaron\n\n1707\n\nAny comments or suggestion are welcomed\n\nDT","a":"—","d":"","n":"#15","p":3,"im":["b0b77193433fa764ee4b6f0cbd924ab3dcb7a681","f747de03ec1dac948ff7f845c93606062c219235","61f53751065fa4b613c5bd4cfc7e51f70a4f6949","9f686473e0ccde707d5682164f2235534d628070","469277efac73bf8939cda44ae98d9e43de72f118"],"m":15},{"id":"cppaz_p3_16","t":"Aaron\n\n1707\n\nThe 1st chart shows the actual PAZ, the second shows price reacting to it.\n\nHere are a few more, some of them work like magic\n\nDT","a":"—","d":"","n":"#16","p":3,"im":["c5ff488b106dc7e96c0ca8af394caaa9eca872de","73a975caf199155cf970de5533f4b06d03a7aaf6","302ff6304b5e9ea6448795b40ff8f86d19457401","9224436c83f3897d7272d6fd31ca4ff9644cc084","96fee6bf0fa824f318236e68a0867aa876fdc72b","1834064ace5512d22d2d9b454df7fa0c2f98b2c9","ac00df6af62c49fc125259b7d6125243c2a8e6e9"],"m":16},{"id":"cppaz_p3_17","t":"Harry\n\njust my view on that cp paz and another story how you could read this chart (irrelevant of paz, off topic)\n\n2920","a":"—","d":"","n":"#17","p":3,"im":["e2188101950a5c1d1b80e0a3a2551b92597d77b8"],"m":17},{"id":"cppaz_p3_18","t":"Aaron\n\nCheers Harry,\n\nIt's funny, you know where your green CP PAZ is, I initially had mine marked there, then I looked above and thought, nono, the tails are just clipping the upper wicks, so I made it into the bigger zone on my chart, but yes mate, I fully agree your zone is far better.\n\nGood stuff\n\nDT","a":"—","d":"","n":"#18","p":3,"im":[],"m":18},{"id":"cppaz_p3_19","t":"Hey DT,\n\nIsn't my purple line an area of demand that was not tested?","a":"—","d":"","n":"#19","p":3,"im":["1b654e497d0d5f2260f4fe46ad91032fc93260a2"],"m":19},{"id":"cppaz_p3_20","t":"Here is one example from me. Comments Welcomed!","a":"—","d":"","n":"#20","p":3,"im":["13189e42a1c0bd80629f27ae0ae4939be2c851a8"],"m":20},{"id":"cppaz_p3_21","t":"Aaron\n\nYou know H,\n\nThis level I remember as I thought to myself, is this a good enough spike to down to include within the CP PAZ, in the end I included it because I placed my zone as per my chart below. Well spotted H, you seem to know the CP PAZ pretty well??\n\n1707\n\nHere are a few more examples:\n\nDT","a":"—","d":"","n":"#21","p":3,"im":["13572710401317f00c8f9e2bcd6bfcc6d7eb0e7d","1bedeacf16c646818901fa3e9a0a814700de7c80","9f02ad0a61ce3036bbfd8c0b7e3b8af7831b4136","c06e453b972af4ce5f28acaea7437947c82ba6c2","f53e774c3dec15372131868768f11bcb16f857d4"],"m":21},{"id":"cppaz_p3_22","t":"Aaron\n\nHey H,\n\nThis is how I would have marked the PAZ, I may be wrong here buddy, but I believe the zone may have been a little bigger. The circle is the much awaited engulf into the PAZ\n\n1707\n\nDT","a":"—","d":"","n":"#22","p":3,"im":["808ffa864cc3fa28f50007f004ed590afe22ebcb"],"m":22},{"id":"cppaz_p3_23","t":"Here is an example of CP that failed. Price should have moved to the other side of the CP zone.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#23","p":3,"im":["0d4a4b0cea91a9a463ed0cf507ba881d9540ca1f"],"m":23},{"id":"cppaz_p3_24","t":"Here is another example of a good CP zone. The problem is that it moved too quick to catch an entry. Even in the LTF price moved right through it.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#24","p":3,"im":["5cedc4e8fa4c1d6f0bc8b15c2adb3344285837ce","7033b8f014e5bf7e6599579547997ac132ddba1a"],"m":24},{"id":"cppaz_p3_25","t":"Hey DT,\n\nI am not sure that I would say I know the CP Paz. I do have to say that they are pretty powerful though. I had actually questioned for some time if price needs to move all the way through the zone for it to be taken out, or if price just needs to touch the purple line. Ya know what I mean?","a":"—","d":"","n":"#25","p":3,"im":["13572710401317f00c8f9e2bcd6bfcc6d7eb0e7d"],"m":25}],"images":[{"k":"808ffa864cc3fa28f50007f004ed590afe22ebcb","t":"assets/thumbs/808ffa864cc3fa28f50007f004ed590afe22ebcb.webp","f":"assets/images/808ffa864cc3fa28f50007f004ed590afe22ebcb.png","w":1440,"h":900,"b":122345,"o":"808ffa864cc3fa28f50007f004ed590afe22ebcb.png","p":3,"pid":"cppaz_p3_22"},{"k":"f4e94a8e4b653847db3a5f0d09a17ed336b9ba99","t":"assets/thumbs/f4e94a8e4b653847db3a5f0d09a17ed336b9ba99.webp","f":"assets/images/f4e94a8e4b653847db3a5f0d09a17ed336b9ba99.jpeg","w":1366,"h":594,"b":105054,"o":"f4e94a8e4b653847db3a5f0d09a17ed336b9ba99.jpeg","p":3,"pid":"cppaz_p3_1"},{"k":"f75b484b2dfa5054806f26272fdd491841496c69","t":"assets/thumbs/f75b484b2dfa5054806f26272fdd491